1. Patients of both genders aged 18 years or older;
2. Body Mass Index (BMI) \ 40mm in the knee to be treated, partially responsive to chronic doses of nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drugs (NSAIDs), analgesics, or weak opioids (codeine and tramadol);
5. Ability to understand and provide signed consent through the Informed Consent Form (ICF).

Exclusion Criteria:

